# Base URL of the ExamQuiz AI backend API, reachable from the BROWSER (not
# from wherever you run the build) - this must be the public HTTPS URL of
# your deployed backend, e.g. https://api.examquizai.com
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite only exposes env vars prefixed VITE_ to client code, and it
# bakes them into the JS bundle AT BUILD TIME - this is not a runtime secret
# store. Anything placed here (or any VITE_ var) ends up readable in the
# browser's network tab / bundled JS, by design. Never put a secret behind a
# VITE_ prefix; this app has none (JWT auth lives entirely client-side in
# memory/localStorage per user, never in a build-time env var).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-domain.example.com
